        "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/zipball/2026.9.0",
        "body": "This release introduces Enterprise Cloud, a new tier with Identity and Access Management, Single Sign-On, Audit Logs, and Dedicated Support, alongside an AI Assistant for Enterprise Self-Host that can edit and run requests, manage collections and environments, publish documentation, and manage mock servers, plus AI skills and configurable provider connections.\r\n\r\nRelease notes: https://hoppscotch.com/releases/release-notes-v2026-9-0\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* chore(common): add missing Turkish locale keys by @qwist1233-cpu in https://github.com/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/pull/6654\r\n* fix(backend): allow userEmail filter in allShortcodes query by @mirarifhasan in https://github.com/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/pull/6679\r\n* feat(common): add AI chat bot by @nivedin in https://github.com/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/pull/6670\r\n* chore: patch high severity vulnerabilities in backend deps and caddy by @mirarifhasan in https://github.com/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/pull/6689\r\n* chore: bump version to `2026.9.0` by @mirarifhasan in https://github.com/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/pull/6694\r\n* refactor: TeamAccessRole import to workspace service by @anwarulislam in https://github.com/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/pull/6697\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @qwist1233-cpu made their first contribution in https://github.com/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/pull/6654\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/compare/2026.8.2...2026.9.0",
